<!doctype html>
<html><body style="font:15px/1.55 -apple-system,BlinkMacSystemFont,'Segoe UI',sans-serif;color:#0f172a;max-width:560px;margin:0 auto;padding:24px;">
<p>Hi{% if ctx.contact_name %} {{ ctx.contact_name }}{% endif %},</p>
<p>Following up on the audit I sent for <a href="{{ ctx.url }}">{{ ctx.url }}</a>.</p>
{% if ctx.top_missing_comparative %}
<p>One comparative query you're invisible for in ChatGPT / Perplexity:</p>
<blockquote style="border-left:3px solid #0f172a;padding:6px 14px;margin:10px 0;color:#334155;">{{ ctx.top_missing_comparative[0].query }}</blockquote>
<p>That's a high-intent buyer query — they're looking to make a decision and your post isn't in the answer.</p>
{% endif %}
<p><a href="{{ ctx.report_url }}" style="display:inline-block;padding:10px 18px;background:#0f172a;color:#fff;text-decoration:none;border-radius:6px;font-weight:600;">Full report</a></p>
<p style="color:#94a3b8;font-size:12px;">— AEGIS Autopilot</p>
<img src="{{ ctx.report_url }}/p.gif" width="1" height="1" alt="" style="display:block;border:0;">
</body></html>
